# ripgrep / ugrep skip these (git still tracks them).  Per-site pin censuses are 10+ MB of
# JSONL each: a recursive search over ledger/ would read them in full every time.  Search them
# on purpose with `rg --no-ignore`, or read them with python.
pins.jsonl
pins_site.jsonl
# untracked local caches; cache/gate_history.jsonl is every gate verdict ever appended (tools/build/gate_all.py)
cache/
